(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-15","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["天[[scarcely|刚刚]]亮，我们带着巡查员来到印厂。主管说改版经基金[[sanction|批准]]，让人把旧样的[[reverse|背面]]翻过来。一份纸张[[analysis|分析]]记录压在儿童[[kite|风筝]]下面，阳台[[rail|栏杆]]挂满宣传旗。新人去度[[honeymoon|蜜月]]，负责校对的唐姨代班。她指着歌颂港口[[affluence|富裕]]的宣传册，问我们是不是要[[select|选择]]封面。程雾说我们只想看运输单。唐姨脸上的笑渐渐收住，远处机器的[[rhythm|节奏]]却没停，纸一张接着一张出来。","唐姨承认自己的[[curiosity|好奇]]让她留下了弃样。新版更[[fashionable|时髦]]，把日期[[lift|抬高]]到醒目的位置，却可能[[mislead|误导]]收货人。穿[[jean|牛仔布]]围裙的主管说这指责近乎[[aggression|攻击]]，他要[[oppose|反对]]查看旧样。巡查员没有与他吵，等基金[[attorney|律师]]电话接通。程雾用等待的空隙检查灯下纸边，[[concentration|专注]]得连叫她喝水都没听见。唐姨说她本想[[devise|设计]]一个省纸版式，结果那一小块被别人换过，字体却沿用她的。","我[[lightly|轻轻地]]拿起透明压纸板，变化是[[gradual|逐步的]]：初稿写旧港，次稿写南渠，终稿只留木星图案的[[jupiter|木星]]货运商标。每次[[alteration|改动]]都有时间，足以[[solve|解释]]为什么账面绕了一圈。基金律师在电话里[[advocate|主张]]旧稿无效；唐姨说她有[[compassion|同情心]]，却不能把援助当擦掉地址的理由。表面的[[apparent|明显]]差别只是字号，真正会[[lose|丢失]]的是南渠两字。我把那处放大，发现刮去地址的人还留下了半个渠字。","外头临时[[barricade|路障]]拦住货车。巡查员举着[[lamp|灯]]寻找电表，老陈发现旧式[[analogue|模拟]]计数器仍在转。机器账可以[[support|支持]]唐姨的记忆，却也迫使我们[[curb|控制]]结论：印错并不等于知道箱里有什么。一个自称主管[[relative|亲戚]]的[[journalist|记者]]问有没有黑幕，我没有回答。我们沿纸箱堆绕过印好的[[merchandise|商品]]，在院子[[terrain|地形]]低处看到一盏[[lantern|提灯]]。夜班装车的人还没下班，灯是为他们照台阶，不是藏秘密的道具。","夜班工人的[[analytic|善于分析的]]习惯出乎我意料。他[[challenge|质疑]]称重单，因为自己的[[engagement|订婚]]戒指曾掉进纸缝，翻找时记住了同一箱号。提起此事他有些[[emotional|激动]]，主管却说戴[[protective|防护的]]手套怎么会掉戒指。他摘下手套，让我们看裂口，说省用品的人像[[miser|吝啬鬼]]，不肯[[upgrade|升级]]旧设备。他曾把戒指[[lay|放]]在机器罩上，风从半开的窗吹进来。那晚纸卷的磨痕与今日相同，重箱的号码却多了一位尾数。","程雾测了院内[[atmospheric|大气的]]背景声，排除了录音被机器节奏误导的可能。旧输纸带已有一道[[rupture|裂口]]，主管想用工人失误把追问[[constrain|限制]]在印错一页。我把三版纸并排，尾数加在印刷之后，笔压穿过四层副联，说明有人现场改货号。唐姨第一次离开柜台，指出领走空白联的车属于基金运输队。巡查员登记旧稿和工人联系方式；程雾给老陈贴好磨破手指的创口贴。我们要去清运公司的称重房，那里的秤，应该还记得纸上不肯留下的重量。"],"en":["Day had [[scarcely|scarcely]] broken when we reached the printer with an inspector. The manager said the fund had given [[sanction|sanction]] for revisions and turned an old proof to its [[reverse|reverse]]. A paper [[analysis|analysis]] report lay beneath a child's [[kite|kite]], while flags covered the balcony [[rail|rail]]. A newlywed proofreader was away on [[honeymoon|honeymoon]], and Aunt Tang covered the shift. Pointing at a brochure praising port [[affluence|affluence]], she asked whether we would [[select|select]] a cover. Cheng asked for transport forms. Tang's smile faded, but the machine's [[rhythm|rhythm]] continued.","Tang's [[curiosity|curiosity]] had made her keep discarded proofs. The more [[fashionable|fashionable]] revision would [[lift|lift]] the date into prominence, potentially helping [[mislead|mislead]] receivers. The manager, in a [[jean|jean]] apron, called this [[aggression|aggression]] and would [[oppose|oppose]] inspection. The inspector waited for the fund's [[attorney|attorney]] to answer. Cheng examined the paper edges with such [[concentration|concentration]] that she missed an offer of water. Tang had tried to [[devise|devise]] a paper-saving layout. Someone replaced a small section while retaining her typeface.","I [[lightly|lightly]] lifted the clear plate. The change was [[gradual|gradual]]: the first draft named the old port, the next South Channel, the last retained only a [[jupiter|Jupiter]] freight logo. Each [[alteration|alteration]] had a time, helping [[solve|solve]] the apparent circular journey. The attorney would [[advocate|advocate]] treating old proofs as invalid. Tang said [[compassion|compassion]] did not justify erasing an address. The [[apparent|apparent]] difference was type size; what we would [[lose|lose]] was South Channel. Enlarging the scrape revealed half of its final character.","A temporary [[barricade|barricade]] halted a truck outside. While the inspector held a [[lamp|lamp]] near the meter, Chen found an old [[analogue|analogue]] counter still moving. Machine logs could [[support|support]] Tang's memory, but we had to [[curb|curb]] our conclusions: printing an error did not establish knowledge of the contents. A [[journalist|journalist]] claiming to be the manager's [[relative|relative]] asked about scandal. I gave no answer. Beyond printed [[merchandise|merchandise]], a [[lantern|lantern]] lit the lower [[terrain|terrain]] of the yard for night workers still loading. It served their feet, rather than theatrical secrecy.","One worker had an unexpectedly [[analytic|analytic]] habit. He could [[challenge|challenge]] the weighing sheet because searching for his dropped [[engagement|engagement]] ring had made him remember a crate number. He became [[emotional|emotional]]. The manager asked how a ring could fall through [[protective|protective]] gloves. The worker showed a split and said the [[miser|miser]] who bought supplies refused to [[upgrade|upgrade]] equipment. He had chosen to [[lay|lay]] his ring on the housing as wind came through the window. The paper roll's scrape matched today's, but the heavy crate's number now had an extra final digit.","Cheng recorded [[atmospheric|atmospheric]] background sound, ruling out confusion caused by the machine rhythm. A [[rupture|rupture]] in the feed belt gave the manager a way to [[constrain|constrain]] discussion to a worker's misprint. I placed the drafts together. The digit had been added after printing, its pen pressure crossing four duplicate layers: somebody changed the number on site. Tang stepped away from her counter and identified the fund truck that collected blank forms. The inspector registered the proofs and contacts. Cheng dressed Chen's scraped finger. We would visit the removal company's weigh house; its scales might preserve the weight the paper refused to keep."]});
